      "claim": "Fairtrade International’s certification scheme only covers product categories listed on its official eligible‑product list, which includes agricultural goods, some textiles and a few processed foods, but does not include electronic devices.",
      "evidence": "Fairtrade International’s publicly available “eligible product categories” document (2023‑2024) lists coffee, tea, cocoa, bananas, cotton, sugar, etc., and explicitly states that electronics are outside the scope of the Fairtrade Standard.",
