      "id": 4,
      "claim": "Because no laptop meets the Fairtrade certification criteria, a laptop cannot be purchased that is officially labeled as “Fair Trade.”",
      "evidence": "A product can only be marketed with the Fairtrade label if it has been certified under the Fairtrade Standard; absence of certification means the label cannot be applied.",
